### Peticiones de prueba manual (extensión REST Client de VS Code).
### Arranca antes la API: .venv\Scripts\python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Ruta inexistente (404 en JSON)
GET {{base}}/does-not-exist

### H1 · Crear solicitud (201)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop request",
  "description": "I need a new laptop for the development team."
}

### H1 · Los espacios de los extremos se recortan (201, title "Access to CRM")
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   Access to CRM   ",
  "description": "   Read access for the sales team.   "
}

### H1 · Los campos extra se ignoran (201, sin "priority" en la respuesta)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop request",
  "description": "I need a new laptop.",
  "priority": "high"
}

### H1 · Error: falta title (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "I need a new laptop."
}

### H1 · Error: title no es texto (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": 123,
  "description": "I need a new laptop."
}

### H1 · Error: title solo con espacios (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "     ",
  "description": "I need a new laptop."
}

### H1 · Error: title de 101 caracteres (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "description": "I need a new laptop."
}

### H1 · Error: falta description (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop request"
}

### H1 · Error: description no es texto (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop request",
  "description": null
}

### H1 · Error: description vacía (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop request",
  "description": ""
}

### H1 · Error: JSON malformado (400)
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Laptop request", "description": 

### H1 · Error: description de más de 1000 caracteres (400)
### Se prueba con los tests automáticos (límites de 1000 y 1001 caracteres); para probarla a mano, pega aquí una descripción de 1001 caracteres.

